  "method": "Two 8-second M1 Instruments Performance Limiters traces, each running packaged memory and vectorized stream probe processes sequentially, with order reversed. Each probe executed eight passes over 16,777,216 floats and verified the independent CPU FMA checksum. Summaries select their PID from the same device-wide counter export. Raw traces remain local.",
